# The Datalinks' Tech Advances list: a ListBox with a Scroll bar. The list as it opens, the scroll
# bar's down arrow (three clicks), a click on the track below the thumb, Page Down, a click on an item
# (selects it, and the page beside the list follows), the up arrow, and a double click. Leave time
# after each step; the snaps take 2 s each.
25 load
42 key F1
48 snap list-open
52 click 329 477          # the down arrow
53 click 329 477
54 click 329 477
58 snap down-arrow
62 click 329 400          # the track below the thumb
66 snap track
70 key Next               # Page Down
74 snap page-down
78 click 200 150          # an item
82 snap item
86 click 329 72           # the up arrow
90 snap up-arrow
94 dblclick 200 230       # an item, twice: the Datalinks follows it
99 snap double-click
103 key Escape
110 close
